<title>USA: Atlantic Express sets $110 mln 144A notes.</title>
<headline>Atlantic Express sets $110 mln 144A notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The issue from Atlantic Express Transporation Corp was priced in the 144A private placement market on Thursday, according to sole manager Jefferies &amp; Co Inc.</p>
<p>BORROWER ATLANTIC EXPRESS TRANSPORATION CORP</p>
<p>AMT $110 MLN	 COUPON 10.75 PCT  MATURITY 2/01/2004</p>
<p>TYPE SNR SEC NOTES ISS PRICE 100.00  FIRST PAY DATE 8/01/97 LAST MOODY'S B2    YIELD 10.75 PCT   PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P SINGLE-B  SPREAD 428 BPS    CALLABLE AFTER 4-YEARS</p>
<p>NOTES: THREE YEAR EQUITY CALL FOR 1/3 OF ISSUE AT 110.75 U.S. corporate bond unit, 212 859-1678</p>
</text>
